                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I loved visiting Parko Parco’s new location! The old location was small and cozy, but the new location is so much more classy, and still very cozy! Everything tasted just as good as I remembered, and the seasonal crab squid ink pasta was phenomenal. Really really wish they’d serve their sister store’s cannoli and gelato here though 🥹 definitely felt like some desserts would’ve wrapped up the night even more perfectly.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
