                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "This place is so cute! Feels like Italy 😍 Every dish was so tasty and the wine pairing was perfect. We had the red wine of the day which was Circo Rosso and apart from the regular menu they also had daily specials 😋 The staff was very helpful and knowledgeable and took good care of us throughout the meal 🙏 The parts of meat that are cooked here cannot be found in many places in Taipei! Very special place ✨",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
